Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "SideImpactCollisionRisk" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle entering intersection" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle pulling into path creating high collision probability" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.92"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Vehicle entering the intersection from the side, posing a significant collision risk to the ego vehicle.
Severity Score: 0.92